    {
      "key": "charcoal_masonry",
      "finding": "B is ProjRed|Exploration:projectred.exploration.stone metadata4, Basalt Brick. Installed Exploration annotation names the namespace; BlockDecoratives passes projectred.exploration.stone to MrTJPCore BlockCore, which calls GameRegistry.registerBlock. Installed language maps stone|4 to Basalt Brick. Enum data and texture registration connect basalt_brick to assets/projectred/textures/blocks/world/basalt_brick.png. Exploration Module is enabled in current config. This is ordinary textured masonry, not an emissive block.",
