      "key": "concrete_frames_and_paving",
      "finding": "K is chisel:nucrete metadata7 (Dark Concrete Tiles); L/P is chisel:nucrete metadata15 (Light Concrete Tiles). The installed feature explicitly associates7 with nucrete/darktiles and15 with nucrete/lighttiles, then registerAll(...,\"nucrete\"). K was selected after observed render QA found the earlier metadata1 riveted panel too industrial for the clean masonry direction. CarvableHelper registers that name under installed modid chisel. A repeated albedo contact sheet does not certify final in-game seams. Current nucrete=true.",
