    {
      "key": "road_surface",
      "finding": "R is a separate wearing-course proposal chisel:concrete metadata10, Asphalt. Installed feature associates10 with concrete/asphalt and registers concrete. Structural F remains minecraft:stonebrick metadata0; no existing civil palette/model is replaced by this research. The legacy config fullBlockConcrete=false comment was not treated as shape proof: the installed BlockConcrete implementation has no geometry override and only adds a movement event handler. A binary class-reference scan found fullBlockConcrete only in Configurations, not a block geometry implementation. Movement and collision still require game verification.",
