    {
      "key": "glass",
      "finding": "G is minecraft:stained_glass metadata7, gray. Alternative metadata3 light blue is provided for comparison. D is the same block metadata0, white, for a lamp housing/diffuser. Installed vanilla StainedGlass indexes icons by placed metadata and uses inverted dye-name indexing:7\u2192gray,3\u2192light_blue,0\u2192white. Inventory metadata remains identical. All three actual PNGs contain alpha and are preserved without flattening. A white stained-glass diffuser has no intrinsic emitted light; place the actual emitter separately. Blue-gray appearance depends on surroundings, alpha compositing and shader settings.",
