    {
      "key": "cyan_light",
      "finding": "N remains ExtraUtilities:greenscreen metadata9. Installed color9 is RGB0,1,1; the actual raw albedo is multiplied by cyan for display. Its getLightLevel is int((r+g+b)/3*15), so cyan emits scalar light10; white metadata0 emits15. This is independent of its fullBrightBlockID renderer. A shader material-map or fullbright surface is not itself evidence of emitted world light. Restrained strips should use measured in-game light checks when arranging actual coverage.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "verification/installed-palette-2026-11-23/Caelestis-metadata-light.txt",
          "lines": [
            34,
